tps://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"labeled","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2023-08-20T14:56:04Z","label":{"name":"area: Font Optimization","color":"0D3A54"},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/next.js/issues/comments/1685458631","html_url":"https://github.com/vercel/next.js/issues/54304#issuecomment-1685458631","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/next.js/issues/54304","id":1685458631,"node_id":"IC_kwDOBC3Cis5kdg7H","user":{"login":"indraantoor","id":64259328,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0MjU5MzI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64259328?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/indraantoor","html_url":"https://github.com/indraantoor","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/indraantoor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/indraantoor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/indraantoor/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/indraantoor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/indraantoor/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/indraantoor/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/indraantoor/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/indraantoor/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/indraantoor/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-08-21T00:46:41Z","updated_at":"2023-08-21T00:57:46Z","body":"It seems like in the case of the URL generated by `next/font`, there might be an issue in the sorting function, if a sorting function is being called during the generation of the URL.\r\n\r\n**Explanation:**\r\n\r\nConsider an array named \"numbers\" with the values (weights of fonts) assigned to it.\r\n\r\n`const numbers = [\"100\", \"200\", \"300\", \"400\", \"500\", \"600\", \"700\", \"800\", \"900\", '1000'];`\r\n\r\nWhen the sort function is called on it without passing any comparison function, it gives us the result:\r\n\r\n`[\"100\", \"1000\", \"200\", \"300\", \"400\", \"500\", \"600\", \"700\", \"800\", \"900\"] `\r\n\r\nwhich is \"not\" the desired outcome. \r\n\r\nThe reason is, due to the default behaviour of the Array.prototype.sort() method in JavaScript. When no comparison function is provided, the sort() method converts the elements of the array to strings and then performs a lexicographic (dictionary-style) sorting.\r\n\r\nIn this case, all the elements in the \"numbers\" array are strings, so they are sorted lexicographically. When lexicographically sorted, \"1000\" comes before \"200\" because \"1\" comes before \"2\" in the character encoding.\r\n\r\nBy providing the comparison function (a, b) => parseInt(a) - parseInt(b), it will ensure that the elements are compared as integers, and thus the sorting will be done numerically.\r\n\r\nI think we should check where this sorting is taking place. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/next.js/issues/comments/1685458631/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"indraantoor","id":64259328,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0MjU5MzI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64259328?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ind